## Third-party notices

This repository contains installation glue and documentation only. It does not
vendor or redistribute any third-party software or model weights; `install.sh`
downloads them from their upstream sources, which remain governed by their own
licences.

- [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp) - MIT. The inference runtime.
- [Gemma 4](https://ai.google.dev/gemma) - Google's model, Apache-2.0.
- HauhauCS uncensored Gemma 4 fine-tunes - Apache-2.0 per the upstream cards.

The default model is an uncensored fine-tune. It will comply with requests that
a safety-tuned model would refuse. You are responsible for what you serve and to
whom, and for the security of the LAN endpoint this bundle exposes.
